  "prefLabel": "He-C 6340.14 Quality Assurance Activities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 6340.14 Quality Assurance Activities. Providers shall be subject to review by DCYF to determine the quality of services pursuant to RSA 170-G:4 XVIII, including a random, retrospective examination of adoptive history reports and adoptive home study reports.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-C 6340) #9264, eff 9-20-08; ss by #12059, eff 12-6-16 (from He-C 6340.16)",
